      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This could be accomplished by a simple script that watched the picture directory for changes, and uploads the new image immediately \nI'm not a windows dev, but this seems like a good start for this: https://stackoverflow.com/questions/760904/how-can-i-monitor-a-windows-directory-for-changes#760933\nAll you'd need to do is hook up an image host, and a webhook integration (upside this would work without discord even running)",
