  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "A mod I used (or more a group of them) allowed me to have any photo I took be uploaded to discord and be posted via a discord bot. I personally am in no rush/not expecting this to be a thing, but having my old vrc photos deleted when i moved PCs made me appreciate this mod A LOT (even tho i was late to using it).",
